+ * since its last swap; the CPU copy waits for that process's own last job (not everyone's) and never shows a
+ * frame whose drawing has not finished before 60 vsyncs (was 6); SwapWait (selector 6) blocks until the swap is
+ * on the panel (at most 50 ms). The 5 s statistics count all of this with or without the boot-arg.
