+static bool sweet_fb_opaque_flag = true;   /* 0172: sweetfbopaqueflag, see sweet_fb_layer_is_opaque */
+/*
+ * 0184: IOMobileFramebuffer layers persist across swaps. A swap carries only the layers it sets (rec+0x104; a NULL
+ * surface = enable bit with id 0 = layer off); one it does not mention keeps its previous surface and rects.
+ * CoreAnimation sends just its own layer (1) when only the UI changed and leaves the game's (0) as it was: the kernel
