+ */
+static bool sweet_fb_high_on_top = true;
+/*
+ * 0236: the Dynamic Island over a full-screen game. 0225 sent every game frame whose (otherwise transparent)
+ * CoreAnimation layer had a visible pixel in its top/bottom edge band to the CPU blend: the game ran much slower,
+ * and the island still did not show (presentComposed's own 8x8 alpha grid left the layer out). Now the frame stays
